# forge script transaction logs. `contracts/cache/<script>/` is where forge
# writes the "sensitive values" copy of a run, and it is already covered by
# `contracts/cache/` above — keep it that way.
#
# `broadcast/` is only a local record: the durable one is
# `deployments/base-sepolia.json`, which is committed, plus Basescan itself.
broadcast/

# Generated by `npm run slither:report`. The reviewed findings and their status
# live in DEPLOYMENT.md, which is the version worth reading.
slither-report.md
